  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/983/world-border-variant-header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"71\"></p>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這個簡單的邊界變體資源包將原版預設的邊界圖片替換為現代化且更易於辨識的世界邊界。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原版的邊界在白天有時很難看到，而且必須靠近才能看清。現在您可以輕鬆地從遠處查看世界邊界。此外，它在夜間會顯示不同顏色的色調。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>請參考以下範例</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">白天：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/984/2024-09-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/985/2024-09-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">夜晚：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/986/2024-09-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/990/2024-09-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就購買伺服器，與朋友一起遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p s